{
  "about": "Evidence for every Android package a mark claims in web/app-marks.js (packages: [...]): an app with one of these packages shows that mark by default (web/app-edit.js). tests/app-edit.test.js fails unless every package in app-marks.js is here under the same mark, and every package here is in app-marks.js.",
  "checked": "2026-11-02",
  "method": "play: the package's Google Play page (https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=<package>, hl=en, gl=GB, else gl=US for US-only apps) answered HTTP 200 with this title and developer; tvScreenshots: the page has a TV form-factor tab (an Android TV build). installed: in the installed-package list of one of the project's sticks (Xiaomi TV Stick 4K or Hugsun HS89) as recorded for this change on 2026-11-02, for packages with no store page.",
  "notMapped": {
    "com.skyglass.v2": "An IPTV app on the Xiaomi stick, not Sky's; It was given the IPTV mark by hand. Never map it to sky.",
    "com.google.android.youtube.tvkids": "YouTube Kids for Android TV (named by APK mirrors), but its Google Play page answers 404 (gl=GB and gl=US): unconfirmed, left out.",
    "com.bskyb.skygo": "Sky Go (Sky UK Limited) is on Google Play but has no TV build; sky has no Android TV app, so sky is picker-only.",
    "showtime": "No Showtime app on Google Play (com.showtime.standalone, com.showtime.showtimeanytime, com.cbs.showtime all 404, gl=GB and gl=US); showtime is picker-only.",
    "smarttube": "SmartTube is not on Google Play (every candidate package 404); its own build declares its package, but none was confirmed on a Play page or a stick, so smarttube is picker-only. Unconfirmed on Google Play: not distributed there (all candidates 404). Source build.gradle (github.com/yuliskov/SmartTube master) declares applicationId org.smarttube.stable (ststable), org.smarttube.beta (stbeta), app.smarttube.fdroid (stfdroid); not verified against an installed copy. Checked 2026-11-02."
  },
